{"seq":3,"slug":"the-art-of-leadership","title":"The Art Of Leadership","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-art-of-leadership","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"recognizing-talent","title":"知人善任","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-art-of-leadership/recognizing-talent","wordCount":2087,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"leading-by-example","title":"以身作则","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/zeng-guofan/ideas-and-methods/the-art-of-leadership/leading-by-example","wordCount":1757,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现曾国藩的用人之道与领导智慧。&quot;知人善任&quot;——善于识人、用人、培养人才——使曾国藩网罗、培养了李鸿章等一大批杰出人才。&quot;以身作则&quot;&quot;以德服人&quot;&quot;严于律己&quot;——以自己的人格、修养、表率来领导、感召他人——则体现了&quot;修身与领导统一&quot;的深刻智慧。本章揭示曾国藩杰出的领导智慧，对当代组织管理仍有重要借鉴。</p>\n"}